  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Empowering Livelihoods and Economic Vitality in Fragile and Conflict Zones</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Economic Resilience of Displacement-affected Communities: Enhance local economies, facilitate access to short-term and sustainable livelihoods, and enhance local economic infrastructure in displacement-affected communities and areas experiencing strong out-migration pressure. Empowerment of Marginalized Groups: Promote social and economic integration of marginalized groups with a focus on conflict sensitivity to mitigate negative coping strategies and address drivers of instability.</narrative>
  </description>
  <description type="2">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">To strengthen community resilience and foster economic recovery by providing short-term employment and sustainable livelihoods for IDPs, returnees, migrants, and other vulnerable populations, while enhancing local economic infrastructure and building income-generating capacities in a conflict-sensitive manner(&#xc131;&#xacfc;&#xbaa9;&#xd45c; 1) &#xb2e8;&#xae30; &#xc18c;&#xb4dd; &#xcc3d;&#xcd9c; &#xae30;&#xd68c; &#xc81c;&#xacf5;&#xc744; &#xd1b5;&#xd55c; &#xacbd;&#xc81c;&#xc801; &#xd68c;&#xbcf5; &#xc9c0;&#xc6d0;
(&#xc131;&#xacfc;&#xbaa9;&#xd45c; 2) &#xc9c0;&#xc5ed; &#xc911;&#xc18c;&#xc0ac;&#xc5c5;&#xccb4; &#xc9c0;&#xc6d0;&#xc744; &#xd1b5;&#xd55c; &#xc9c0;&#xc18d;&#xac00;&#xb2a5;&#xd55c; &#xc77c;&#xc790;&#xb9ac; &#xcc3d;&#xcd9c;
(&#xc131;&#xacfc;&#xbaa9;&#xd45c; 3) &#xc9c0;&#xc18d;&#xac00;&#xb2a5;&#xd55c; &#xacbd;&#xc81c; &#xac1c;&#xbc1c;&#xc744; &#xc704;&#xd55c; &#xcc38;&#xc5ec;&#xc801; &#xc9c0;&#xc5ed; &#xac70;&#xbc84;&#xb10c;&#xc2a4; &#xad6c;&#xcd95;
(&#xc131;&#xacfc;&#xbaa9;&#xd45c; 4) &#xcde8;&#xc57d;&#xacc4;&#xce35; &#xb300;&#xc0c1; &#xc0dd;&#xacc4; &#xc5ed;&#xb7c9; &#xac15;&#xd654;
(&#xc131;&#xacfc;&#xbaa9;&#xd45c; 5) &#xcde8;&#xc57d;&#xacc4;&#xce35; &#xc0ac;&#xd68c;&#xc7ac;&#xd1b5;&#xd569;&#xc744; &#xd1b5;&#xd55c; &#xc9c0;&#xc5ed; &#xcde8;&#xc57d;&#xc131; &#xc545;&#xd654; &#xc694;&#xc778; &#xacbd;&#xac10;</narrative>
